      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/thisara\">@Thisara</a></p>\n<p>In that case, you should not create DN but sales invoice <strong>update stock</strong> check box can help you get book COGS and Income at the same time.</p>",
