      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-09-23T11:50:23.277Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/thisara\">@Thisara</a></p>\n<p>This was infact perpetual inventory system where ERPNext books COGS at the time of DN working with valuation process for each item under a warehouse.</p>\n<p>On the the other hand, periodic inventory settings in company doctype will help you create DN without booking any accounting for COGS which you can then book periodically by consulting stock balance report.</p>",
